  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutionalization of Robust Fiscal and Financial Management Capacities in the Public Administration</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This technical assistance will support the Ministry of Finance and the Comptroller General of Dominican Republic to strengthen their capacities to carry out strong fiscal analysis, robust financial management abilities of public officials, and increase the audit role of the government. Given the broad weaknesses of the public institutions to increase public sector&apos;s performance, the grant will focus in particular two key units: the Analysis and Fiscal Policy Unit (Unidad de An&#xe1;lisis y Pol&#xed;tica Fiscal) and the Center for Policy Training and Fiscal Management (Centro de Capacitaci&#xf3;n de Pol&#xed;tica y Gesti&#xf3;n Fiscal, CAPGEFI) of the Ministry of Finance. The CEPGEFI&apos;s unit will perform dual function providing training support to the officials of the Ministry of Finance, as well as to the Comptroller General of the Republic. The assistance will lever the fiscal analysis capacity through supporting the systematic production and dissemination of fiscal reports to assess and forecast economic and social effects of revenues and expenditure options, and will fortify the financial management abilities through training public officials, and introducing new training modalities, for instance e-learning.</narrative>
  </description>
